# 8.3.2 — what Prettier must NOT touch. Paired with `npm run format`, which names the scope
# positively; this file is the second belt, for anyone who runs `npx prettier --write .` by hand.

# ── vendored / installed ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
venv/
.venv/

# ── transient ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
temp/
output/
sliced_audios/
.pytest_cache/

# ── 🔴 GENERATED. tools/build_webui.mjs writes this from the modules under src/webui/js/. ────
# Reformatting it would be undone by the next `npm run build`, and while it sat reformatted the
# `--check` mode would report the bundle as stale against a tree that had not changed.
src/webui/bundle/

# ── 🔴 src/webui/index.html IS EXACTLY AT A HARD TEST CEILING. ───────────────────────────────
# tests/test_webui_size.py:94 sets PAGE_LINE_CEILING = 2_000 and asserts `n <= PAGE_LINE_CEILING`;
# the file is at 2000 lines right now, so ONE added line is a red suite. Prettier reformats HTML
# and its embedded <script>, so running it here is an instant failure. There is almost nothing to
# win either way — the 7.3 frontend split moved the code out into src/webui/js/, and only four
# dense `keyword(` hits remain in the page. Raising that ceiling is a deliberate decision about
# page weight (DESIGN §1.1 item 3) and needs its own argument, not a bump to get green.
src/webui/index.html

# ── types/*.d.ts — hand-written TypeScript declarations, deliberately NOT reformatted. ───────
# They are not "the JavaScript source" this pass is about; they were hand-formatted with their
# arguments in comments beside each widening, and test_webui_types.py counts the members of
# dom-permissive.d.ts LINE BY LINE as a ratchet. Re-wrapping there buys nothing and can only move
# a number that exists to be hard to move.
types/

# ── everything Prettier also knows how to format, and which nobody asked it to ───────────────
# This formatting pass targets JavaScript source only; documentation and data files stay unchanged.
*.md
*.json
*.jsonc
*.yaml
*.yml
*.css
*.scss
*.html
